      "statement": "Because ice/telemetry/__init__.py re-exports RemoteTelemetryClient from emitter.py, emitter.py's import failure propagates to every module importing from ice.telemetry, including ice/kernel.py, so ICEKernel construction fails at that import statement before ever reaching the separately-documented SecurityManager(license_key) constructor mismatch.",
